		{"id":"supplier-detail-ui","type":"text","text":"**UI Events:**\n- `onGetDirections`: Open maps\n- `onCall`: Phone supplier\n- `onWebsite`: Open website\n- `onShare`: Share offer\n- `onToggleAlert`: Enable notifications\n- `onBack`: Return to feed","x":450,"y":660,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"4"},

		{"id":"offer-claimed","type":"text","text":"## Offer Claimed\n\n**UI Events:**\n- `onShowCode`: Display redemption code\n- `onAddToWallet`: Save to wallet\n- `onShare`: Share with friends","x":1000,"y":0,"width":300,"height":160,"color":"5"},

